# Blank — UI structure

Minimal app shell with the **full `internal/ui` registry tree** for staging reusable UI.
On-disk index: **`internal/ui/README.md`** (same `registry:*` labels as FastyGoUI).

```
internal/ui/
  layout/       # registry:layout — document/chrome shell (stays in app)
  components/   # registry:components — icon, toggles, …
  blocks/       # registry:blocks — dashboard/, marketing/, docs/ (layout organisms)
  widgets/      # registry:widgets — UI + behavior (staging)
  variants/     # registry:variants — wireframe utility maps
  utils/        # registry:utils — app helpers on templ/utils
internal/views/
  *.templ       # route pages (home hero, sample, …)
  layout.templ  # thin route shell adapters (AppShell, …)
  partials/     # shell head assets, header trailing glue
  models.go     # LayoutData, page structs
internal/site/
  router.go     # PageSpec route manifest
  render.go     # handlePage, web.Render
  nav.go        # nav from route specs
  layout_data.go # LayoutData, language switch, assets
  feature.go    # Feature wiring only
internal/fixtures/
  locale/*.json # i18n copy
```

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `internal/ui/layout` | Document/chrome shell; stays in app — **not** every layout variant |
| `internal/ui/components` | Props-only UI; no HTTP or fetch |
| `internal/ui/blocks/<domain>/` | Section/layout organisms → future `fastygo/blocks` |
| `internal/ui/widgets` | Behavior shells → future `fastygo/widgets` |
| `internal/views` | Pages + thin route adapters; not a registry |
| `internal/site` | Runtime routing; not a registry |

**Layout organisms:** `blocks/dashboard/sidebar_app`, `blocks/docs/toc_shell`, `blocks/marketing/topnav_shell` — **not** `blocks/layout/`.

**Forbidden folders:** `internal/ui/recipes`, `internal/ui/elements`, `internal/ui/ui/`, `internal/ui/blocks/layout/`.

**views** receive resolved strings/structs only — no `fixtures.LoadLocale` inside `.templ`.

When adding a page: extend `fixtures.Locale` + every `locale/*.json`, add `internal/views/<page>.templ`, add one `PageSpec` in `internal/site/router.go`.

For sidebar layout history, see git branch **`sidebar`**.
